          <div><p style="font-size: 0.65rem; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Certifications</p><p style="color: #fff; font-size: 0.85rem;">GOTS 7.0, OEKO-TEX, BSCI</p></div>
          <div><p style="font-size: 0.65rem; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Lead Time</p><p style="color: #fff; font-size: 0.85rem;">20-45 days</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- #2 Ha-Meem Group -->
      <div style="border: 1px solid #1a1a1a; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <p style="font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">#2 — Bangladesh</p>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Ha-Meem Group</h3>
        
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Ha-Meem Group operates multiple manufacturing facilities across Bangladesh, with significant capacity in denim and woven garment production. Their denim division is well-established in the industry, serving major international fashion retailers and high-street brands. Their 5,000-piece MOQ reflects a focus on volume orders. The company maintains standard industry certifications including WRAP, BSCI, and SEDEX compliance.</p>

        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8;">Ideal for: Large retailers, established brands with 50,000+ piece seasonal orders, denim-focused brands needing volume production. Likely less suited to: Startups or boutique labels below the 5,000-piece MOQ. See our <a href="/tools/price-calculator/" style="color: #e00; text-decoration: none;">price calculator</a> to compare volume pricing. (Verify current MOQ and certifications directly with Ha-Meem Group.)</p>
