        <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">DBL Group</h3>
        
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">DBL Group is known for knitwear and sweater production, including for European premium fashion brands. Their 3,000-piece MOQ is more accessible than some volume-focused competitors but still excludes the smallest startups. The company holds GOTS certification, making them attractive for sustainable fashion brands. Their vertical integration includes knitting, dyeing, and garment production under one roof.</p>

        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8;">Ideal for: Mid-sized brands, sweater-focused collections, sustainable brands needing GOTS certification. Likely less suited to: Very small startups under 3,000 pieces. Visit our <a href="/certifications" style="color: #e00; text-decoration: none;">certifications page</a> to understand GOTS requirements. (Verify current MOQ and certifications directly with DBL Group.)</p>
