        <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Beximco</h3>
        
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Beximco is one of Bangladesh's largest conglomerates, with diversified business interests including pharmaceuticals and textiles. Their textile division operates at significant scale, with a 10,000-piece MOQ that places them in the large-volume category. The company has expertise in technical fabrics including medical-grade textiles for healthcare applications.</p>

        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8;">Ideal for: Very large retailers, medical textile needs, brands requiring technical fabrics. Likely less suited to: Fashion brands under 10,000 pieces or startups. For <a href="/clothing-manufacturer-canada/" style="color: #e00; text-decoration: none;">Canadian buyers</a>, Beximco's GSP eligibility may offset the high MOQ through duty savings. (Verify current MOQ and certifications directly with Beximco.)</p>
