        <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Square Fashions</h3>
        
        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Square Fashions, part of the Square Group conglomerate, specializes in knitwear with an 8,000-piece MOQ. Their access to the group's yarn production capabilities gives them a degree of control over material costs. They hold OEKO-TEX Standard 100 and GRS certifications, making them suitable for brands with sustainability requirements.</p>

        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8;">Ideal for: Established brands needing 8,000+ piece knitwear orders, sustainable brands requiring GRS certification. Likely less suited to: Startups or brands under 8,000 pieces. <a href="/clothing-manufacturer-germany/" style="color: #e00; text-decoration: none;">German buyers</a> may appreciate Square's GRS certification for circular economy requirements. (Verify current MOQ and certifications directly with Square Fashions.)</p>
