        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Epic Group focuses on woven garments with a 4,000-piece MOQ, particularly shirts and blouses for European mid-market brands. The company maintains environmental certifications alongside BSCI and WRAP compliance.</p>

        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8;">Ideal for: Brands focusing on woven shirts/blouses, mid-market European retailers. Likely less suited to: Knitwear brands or startups under 4,000 pieces. (Verify current MOQ and certifications directly with Epic Group.)</p>
