        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Pacific Jeans specializes in denim production with a 5,000-piece MOQ and is a significant denim exporter serving international denim brands. The company has invested in environmental certifications and maintains BSCI and WRAP compliance.</p>

        <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8;">Ideal for: Denim-focused brands, established retailers with 5,000+ piece denim orders. Likely less suited to: Small startups or brands needing diverse product categories. <a href="/clothing-manufacturer-australia/" style="color: #e00; text-decoration: none;">Australian buyers</a> may find Pacific's denim expertise relevant. (Verify current MOQ and certifications directly with Pacific Jeans.)</p>
