      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Regional Rankings: Notable Manufacturers by Country</h2>

      <!-- Bangladesh -->
      <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Bangladesh Manufacturers</h3>
        <p style="color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Bangladesh accounts for a significant share of global apparel exports, with thousands of BGMEA member factories. The post-Rana Plaza compliance transformation has elevated safety standards, though Bangladesh's LDC graduation in 2026 will introduce tariff changes that may affect sourcing decisions. The country's strength remains in knitwear and denim, with competitive pricing that offsets longer logistics for Western buyers.</p>
        <ul style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; list-style: none; padding-left: 0;">
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>SDF Clothing</strong> — Low MOQ knitwear specialist with GOTS 7.0 certification (this is us)</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Ha-Meem Group</strong> — Large-scale denim and woven production</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>DBL Group</strong> — Knitwear and sweater manufacturer with GOTS certification</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Beximco</strong> — Diversified conglomerate with technical textile expertise</li>
